# No typographic dashes

Never use an em dash (`—`) or en dash (`–`) in this repository.

- In UI copy, comments, strings, tests, and docs, use a hyphen (`-`), colon, period, or rewrite the sentence.
- Empty placeholders must be `"-"` or `"n/a"`, never `"—"`.
- Do not introduce these characters in new files.

This rule applies to application source only (`frontend/src`, `backend/app`, `backend/tests`). Do not edit `node_modules` or `.venv`.
